read and asks for required-checks, preserving readable ruleset/app bindings. SDK close refusals identify item, PR, validation code and missing fields. Both workflows select one privacy-checked annotation from private receipts.\n\nThe earlier complete npm gate passed 1540/1540 and exact 100/100/100/100 across 22 modules; it predates the final normalization adjustment. The full local Bun gate was stopped on the orchestrator instruction and is NOT a pass. No full local gate will be rerun. Current focused checks and CI own final verification; after push the CI wait is capped at 30 minutes. Both items remain open; caller adoption and source remediation stay in pm-github-samq. Main and latest release are still 2b71f73 and v2026.10.26; that release fixes neither incident trigger."
  "2026-10-27T09:45:59.719Z",codex-agent,"Final focused verification after the normalization adjustment: npm run build and npm run build:test passed. node --test --test-concurrency=2 test/scheduled-refusals.test.ts test/import-regex.test.ts test/gate-inputs.test.ts passed 44/44, zero skipped/cancelled. node --test --test-concurrency=2 --test-name-pattern=\"local edits invalidate|clean flow: gated import\" test/import-fidelity.test.ts test/import-gate.test.ts passed 2/2, including real interrupted-journal recovery and clean gated repeat import. npm run lint and npm run docstring passed. A first focused attempt caught the legacy string-tag representation; the final SDK parseTags implementation accepts it and preserves canonical comparison.\n\nAdditional behavioral revert proof: restoring ONLY normalizeImportValue() from origin/main makes node --test --test-concurrency=2 --test-name-pattern=\"unchanged import comparison\" test/scheduled-refusals.test.ts fail 1/1; the final function was restored. The stronger real mixed-batch fixture now includes SDK-normalized body padding. Earlier recorded proofs remain: pages() revert fails --test-name-pattern=\"scheduled numeric pagination none\" test/scheduled-refusals.test.ts; runImport() revert fails --test-name-pattern=\"scheduled repeat\" test/scheduled-refusals.test.ts; closeoutFailureReason() revert fails --test-name-pattern=\"one workflow diagnostic identifies\" test/scheduled-refusals.test.ts; request error-stanza revert fails --test-name-pattern=\"non-retryable 404\" test/http-boundary.test.ts. Each proof uses node --test --test-concurrency=2, expects one failure, and restores the implementation before verification.\n\nNo full local gate was rerun after the resumed instruction. The prior npm 1540/1540 and exact four-dimensional coverage receipt predates the final normalizer. Full Bun was interrupted, not passed. Final full release gates belong to CI. Preparing the unmerged PR; the CI wait is capped at 30 minutes after push