ithub-samq; caller repositories were not modified."
  "2026-10-27T16:00:20.397Z",codex-agent,"Round 2 resumed. General rule: workspace inputs must be resolved by the SDK before reading settings or deriving type/status registries; all comparisons use canonical names from that resolved registry, matching host writes. The prior alias property used a tracker-root fixture and missed a workspace above .agents/pm. Auditing every settings/registry read and type/status comparison, including import, fidelity, refresh, sync, issue forms, closeout and webhook storage. Will add real nested non-git workspace and packed npm/Bun JSON/TOON regressions and function-only revert proof. Main was two commits ahead (release and toolchain update); merging it before implementation. Existing full-gate results remain historical evidence, not verification of this new fix."
